  "content_description": "Empowerment Action Item",
  "content_text_body": "Schedule a meeting with your team where your goal is to spot issues with empowerment and learn how you can help make improvements. As the manager, you'll both facilitate and participate in the discussion.\n\n### Prior to the discussion\n\nAsk your team to jot down answers to the following questions:\n\n> When have you felt empowered in your role? \n\n> Why did it make you feel empowered?\n\n> Have you ever felt disempowered? \n\n> What could have been different to make you feel more empowered? \n\n> Which leaders in the company are good at empowering people?\n\n> What advice do you have for helping me, the team, or the company improve in this area?\n\n### Team discussion on Empowerment\n\nBegin by going over the [Meeting Ground Rules](Glint_General_Team_Meeting_Ground_Rules).\n\nFollow this [Meeting Plan](Glint_Empowerment_Meeting_Plan) to guide your discussion.",
